\frac{3}{2}\), \(2Vu = \frac{3^2}{2^2}\), &c. \(Vd = \frac{2}{3}\), \(2Vd = \frac{2^2}{3^2}\), &c. \(Tu = \frac{5}{4}\), \(2Tu = \frac{5^2}{4^2}\), &c. \(Td = \frac{4}{5}\), \(2Td = \frac{4^2}{5^2}\), &c. and multiply instead of adding, and finally multiply or divide @@R1@@
